  "question": {
    "text": "The number of matrices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, is ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>On comparing both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;gives</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Case-I</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Assuming case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>&nbsp;possibilities</p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>&nbsp;possibilities</p><p>But&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is repeated</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>So, total case will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;(repeated)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></math>&nbsp;pairs.</p><p>case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>23</mn></math>&nbsp;pairs</p><p>case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;pairs</p><p>Case-II</p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p>from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;pairs</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp; Total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math>&nbsp;pairs.</p></blockquote>"
  }
